You asked - we did!

Achievements have been added to the game! Now it will be even more interesting to pass puzzles!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39037861/ba4dd5ebd9289261d2bf834131fac0aaa9422782.png

And also the following changes were added, which were requested by the players themselves:

- added sound settings;
- added permission settings;
- added a button to enable / disable windowed mode;
- added increase / decrease in the height of the camera view with the mouse wheel;
- changed level 14;
- minor bugs and bugs fixed.

 In addition, there is a 66% discount on the game at the moment! 

 Thanks for the feedback to all players! Enjoy your game!
